        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, propane/butane, at boiler condensing modulating 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, propane/butane, at boiler condensing modulating 50kW
Inventory for 1 MJ heat from natural gas, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 50 kW for a multi- family house with 2100 operating hours. Efficiency depends on use patterns such as input and output temperature and is here estimated at partial load (30% load) with efficiency 109.5 % (Hu);
